@startuml
title Séquence — création et exécution d'un AnalysisRun
actor User
participant UI
participant API
participant AnalysisPolicy
participant ScopeResolver
database PostgreSQL
participant Redis
participant Worker
participant ArtifactStore

User -> UI: appliquer configuration
UI -> API: POST /analysis/runs + idempotencyKey
API -> AnalysisPolicy: authorize(project, configuration)
AnalysisPolicy --> API: allowed projection
API -> ScopeResolver: resolve + canonicalize
ScopeResolver -> PostgreSQL: lire versions/sources autorisées
ScopeResolver --> API: manifest + fingerprint + support
API -> PostgreSQL: rechercher succeeded identique
alt cache hit valide
  PostgreSQL --> API: AnalysisRun succeeded
  API --> UI: 200 run
else nouveau run
  API -> PostgreSQL: INSERT run queued (transaction/unique)
  API -> Redis: enqueue(run_id)
  API --> UI: 202 run queued
  Redis -> Worker: task(run_id)
  Worker -> PostgreSQL: lock + running + heartbeat
  Worker -> PostgreSQL: lecture chunkée sources
  Worker -> Worker: calculators versionnés
  Worker -> ArtifactStore: écriture temporaire + checksum
  ArtifactStore --> Worker: référence publiée
  Worker -> PostgreSQL: résultat + succeeded (transaction)
  loop polling/backoff
    UI -> API: GET run
    API -> PostgreSQL: état
    API --> UI: état/progression
  end
end
UI -> API: GET visualization/cases
API --> UI: DTO sémantique paginé
@enduml
